sitory section below must make it explicit which technology each repo uses —                                                                                            [39m    [38;2;153;153;153mthat is the Developer's source of truth for what to build with, where.                                                                                                          [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m-->                                                                                                                                                                               [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153m# Tech Stack                                                                                                                                                                      [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153m## Architecture overview                                                                                                                                                          [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m_How the product's pieces fit together: the components/services, how they communicate,                                                                                            [39m  [38;2;153;153;153mand the cross-cutting choices they share (data storage, auth, deployment/runtime)._                                                                                               [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153m## Conventions                                                                                                                                                                    [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m_Product-wide standards every repository follows: language versions, formatting/linting,                                                                                          [39m  [38;2;153;153;153mtesting approach, commit/branch style, error handling._                                                                                                                           [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153m## Per-repository tech stack                                                                                                                                                      [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m_One section per repository. Add a block for each repo in the project so it is clear,                                                                                             [39m  [38;2;153;153;153mper repo, what technology is used and how to build/test/run it._                                                                                                                  [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153m### <repo-name>                                                                                                                                                                   [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m- **Purpose:** _what this repository is responsible for._                                                                                                                         [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m- **Language / runtime:** _e.g. TypeScript / Node 20._                                                                                                                            [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m- **Frameworks / key libraries:** _the main frameworks and libraries used here._                                                                                                  [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m- **Build / test / run:** _the commands to build, test, and run this repo._                                                                                                       [39m  [38;2;153;153;153m- **Notes:** _conventions or constraints specific to this repository._                                                                                                            [39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          [38;2;153;153;153mThe project has these repositories: metro. In tech.md, add one "### <repo>" block under "Per-repository tech stack" for EACH of them, making the technology used in each repo     [39m  [38;2;153;153;153mexplicit.                                                                                                                                                                         [39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;153;153;153mWhenever you need something from me, end your turn with a clear question — phrased as a question and ending in a question mark — and wait for my answer. That is not a style      [39m  [38;2;153;153;153mpreference: a turn ending in a question mark is what tells the app you are waiting